    "number": 6,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "prepared -- Four prepared things. Jonah 1:17; 4:6,7,8"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 8,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "fainted -- Cf. 1 Kings 19:4-8. Taken as a lesson in service we have in Jonah a servant,\n\n(1) disobedient, Jonah 1:1-11;\n\n(2) afflicted, Jonah 1:12-17;\n\n(3) praying Jonah 2:1-9;\n\n(4) delivered, Jonah 2:10;\n\n(5) recommissioned, Jonah 3:1-3;\n\n(6) powerful, Jonah 3:4-9;\n\n(7) perplexed and fainting but not forsaken, Jonah 4:1-11."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 11,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "Nineveh -- (See Scofield \"Nahum 1:1\")"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
